# CommentsService — change.log

## 1.1.0.1 Init — 2026-10-29

Branch: `CommentsService/v_1.1.0.1_Init`

### English

- Started a new independent development history at Init.
- Added a minimal .NET 10 API with GET /api/status.
- Added an English React start page showing the backend connection state.
- Added build/run instructions, versioning rules and the agreed incremental plan.
- Documentation update within Init: README.md is English, README.RU.md is Russian,
  README.UA.md is Ukrainian; removed the redundant README.en.md and updated language links.
- All supporting documentation is maintained in English, Russian and Ukrainian.
- No database, migrations, comment features, Docker deployment or configuration extraction yet.
- Validation: .NET Release build passed with zero warnings/errors; TypeScript/Vite
  production build passed. Edge verified API metadata, connected/unavailable states,
  English UI, no comments form/API, no JavaScript errors and no overflow at 360 px.
- No unit/integration suite is included in Init; database tests belong to later steps.

